@startuml event-storming
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
title Event Storming — «Будущее 2.0» (события и подписчики)

legend right
  |= Цвет |= Тип |= Описание |
  | <#FFE0B2> | Domain Event | Событие, произошедшее в прошлом |
  | <#BBDEFB> | Command | Действие, инициирующее изменение |
  | <#FFF9C4> | Aggregate | Агрегат-источник события |
  | <#C8E6C9> | Subscriber | Подписчик (Read Model / Policy) |
  | <#E1BEE7> | External System | Внешняя система |
endlegend

' === Fintech Domain Events ===

rectangle "Fintech" #E8F5E9 {
  card "**Создан кредитный договор**\nCreditContractCreated" as E_CreditCreated #FFE0B2
  card "**Открыт счёт**\nAccountOpened" as E_AccountOpened #FFE0B2
  card "**Выполнен платёж**\nPaymentCompleted" as E_PaymentCompleted #FFE0B2
  card "**Кредит погашен**\nCreditRepaid" as E_CreditRepaid #FFE0B2
  
  rectangle "CreditContract" as A_Credit #FFF9C4
  rectangle "Account" as A_Account #FFF9C4
}

E_CreditCreated -[hidden]right-> A_Credit
E_AccountOpened -[hidden]right-> A_Account

' === Medical Domain Events ===

rectangle "Medical" #E3F2FD {
  card "**Зарегистрирован новый пациент**\nPatientRegistered" as E_PatientRegistered #FFE0B2
  card "**Создан приём**\nAppointmentCreated" as E_AppointmentCreated #FFE0B2
  card "**Проведена процедура**\nProcedureCompleted" as E_ProcedureCompleted #FFE0B2
  card "**Выписано назначение**\nPrescriptionIssued" as E_PrescriptionIssued #FFE0B2
  card "**Изменён остаток инвентаря**\nInventoryUpdated" as E_InventoryUpdated #FFE0B2
  
  rectangle "Patient" as A_Patient #FFF9C4
  rectangle "Appointment" as A_Appointment #FFF9C4
  rectangle "Procedure" as A_Procedure #FFF9C4
}

E_PatientRegistered -[hidden]right-> A_Patient
E_ProcedureCompleted -[hidden]right-> A_Procedure

' === AI Domain Events ===

rectangle "AI / Clinical Decision" #FFF3E0 {
  card "**Пройдено исследование ИИ**\nAIResearchCompleted" as E_AIResearchCompleted #FFE0B2
  card "**Получен результат диагностики ИИ**\nAIDiagnosticResultReceived" as E_AIDiagnostic #FFE0B2
  card "**Запущена модель ИИ**\nAIModelInvoked" as E_AIModelInvoked #FFE0B2
  
  rectangle "AIRequest/Result" as A_AI #FFF9C4
}

E_AIResearchCompleted -[hidden]right-> A_AI

' === Analytics (Subscribers) ===

rectangle "Analytics (подписчики)" #F3E5F5 {
  card "Reporting & BI" as S_Reporting #C8E6C9
  card "Analytical Lakehouse" as S_Lakehouse #C8E6C9
}

' === Связи: источник -> подписчик ===

E_CreditCreated -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_AccountOpened -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_PaymentCompleted -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_CreditRepaid -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик

E_PatientRegistered -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик\n(агрегаты)
E_AppointmentCreated -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_ProcedureCompleted -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_InventoryUpdated -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик

E_AIResearchCompleted -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_AIDiagnostic -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик
E_AIModelInvoked -down-> S_Reporting : подписчик

E_CreditCreated -down-> S_Lakehouse
E_AccountOpened -down-> S_Lakehouse
E_PatientRegistered -down-> S_Lakehouse
E_ProcedureCompleted -down-> S_Lakehouse
E_AIResearchCompleted -down-> S_Lakehouse

' === AI подписывается на Medical ===

E_ProcedureCompleted -right-> A_AI : подписчик\n(запрос анализа)
E_AppointmentCreated -right-> A_AI : подписчик

note bottom of S_Reporting
  **Analytics** подписывается на события
  из Fintech, Medical, AI.
  В витрину НЕ включаются:
  мед. карты, истории болезней,
  результаты исследований (PHI).
end note

@enduml
